      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_earnings = 220000\n    social_security_cap = 160200\n    social_security_rate = 0.124\n    medicare_rate = 0.029\n    additional_medicare_threshold = 200000\n    additional_medicare_rate = 0.009\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    social_security_tax = min(net_earnings, social_security_cap) * social_security_rate\n    medicare_tax = net_earnings * medicare_rate\n    additional_medicare_tax = max(\n        0,\n        net_earnings - additional_medicare_threshold\n    ) * additional_medicare_rate\n\n    total_seca_tax = (\n        social_security_tax\n        + medicare_tax\n        + additional_medicare_tax\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_seca_tax, 2)\n```",
